WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.043 --> 00:00:03.080
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:04.293
- Welcome back, everybody!

00:00:04.293 --> 00:00:06.510
Throughout the hour,
we've explored how music

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:09.750
has shaped the pursuit of
equality across this country.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.090
Our next guests are all
about promoting harmony

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:14.880
with their multi-genre acapella vocals.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:18.690
Now performing "I Wish I Knew
How It Would Feel To Be Free,"

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:20.477
give it up for King's Return.

00:00:20.477 --> 00:00:22.281
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:00:22.281 --> 00:00:25.448
